{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方第一行粉色大字“心里又热了起来”，字号最大、亮度高、位置靠前，首先吸引视线；随后视线落到下方同样醒目的红色大字“有了劲头”。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"心里重新热起来，开始有了干劲；具体是什么事情促成这一变化，不确定。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"热烈、兴奋、重新被点燃、有冲劲。\",\n  \"missed\": \"小字补充的“心跳像一下子被推到最高处”，以及右上角全曲阶段目录的具体内容。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"两句大字都很显眼，核心信息分布在两处，需要把“心里又热了起来”和“有了劲头”联系起来才能完整理解。\",\n    \"放大的两处文字分别表达内心变化和状态变化，单独看其中一句都不足以完整交代此刻的处境与感受之间的关系。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e8069ff8-64fa-4dc4-a945-9a0d458da41c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T023926408128Z", "elapsed_seconds": 23.047, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:39:49.451748+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5a5fda98a92afcb96bdb1c4124f8c18af7e308b9ea0b81259c02116cbc958c51", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_att